  "comment": "Stable Strata adapter, model and build metadata. Routine engine upgrades only change the strata backend pins in backend_versions.json. Strata-owned data follows the official repository at that release tag. All runtime Hugging Face assets use their default revision; download hashes come from registry metadata, not fixed model pins here. Download receipts record provenance and actual file sizes; only engine-owned data is release-scoped. The build-time native_utilities dependency remains independently pinned.",
